</svg>
</div></div></div><h4>Driving Adoption</h4><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We operate an end-to-end pipeline from technical innovation to widespread deployment of vetted safety solutions.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="card_primary_element"><div data-wf--icon-by-brand--variant="green" class="card_primary_icon w-variant-a70cd728-ab58-44a2-63b3-85db85238b34"><div class="card_primary_icon-slot"><div aria-hidden="true" data-wf--icon--variant="full" class="u-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12.663 7.74895L7.90503 13.5729V8.71095L13.001 2.44495H16.095V21.5549H12.663V7.74895Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>
</div></div></div><h4>Foundational Research</h4><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We develop novel solutions to technical challenges through our in-house research team.</p></div></div><div class="card_primary_element"><div data-wf--icon-by-brand--variant="green" class="card_primary_icon w-variant-a70cd728-ab58-44a2-63b3-85db85238b34"><div class="card_primary_icon-slot"><div aria-hidden="true" data-wf--icon--variant="full" class="u-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5.708 18.708L10.908 14.106C12.0867 13.0313 13.0573 12 13.82 11.012C14.5827 10.0067 14.964 9.00133 14.964 7.996C14.964 7.19866 14.6953 6.566 14.158 6.098C13.6207 5.61266 12.91 5.37 12.026 5.37C11.0727 5.37 10.3187 5.682 9.764 6.306C9.20933 6.93 8.932 7.75333 8.932 8.776C8.932 9.07066 8.97533 9.478 9.062 9.998L5.578 9.4C5.526 9.05333 5.5 8.70666 5.5 8.36C5.5 7.216 5.786 6.176 6.358 5.24C6.93 4.304 7.71867 3.56733 8.724 3.03C9.72933 2.47533 10.856 2.198 12.104 2.198C13.2827 2.198 14.3573 2.44933 15.328 2.952C16.316 3.43733 17.0873 4.13066 17.642 5.032C18.214 5.916 18.5 6.93866 18.5 8.1C18.5 9.504 18.136 10.7953 17.408 11.974C16.6973 13.1527 15.6227 14.3573 14.184 15.588L10.596 18.682H18.396V21.802H5.708V18.708Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>
</div></div></div><h4>Field Building</h4><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Our convenings and grantmaking build a broader research field around our initial ideas.</p></div></div><div class="card_primary_element"><div data-wf--icon-by-brand--variant="green" class="card_primary_icon w-variant-a70cd728-ab58-44a2-63b3-85db85238b34"><div class="card_primary_icon-slot"><div aria-hidden="true" data-wf--icon--variant="full" class="u-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M11.9481 21.75C10.7694 21.75 9.69478 21.5247 8.72411 21.074C7.77078 20.6233 6.99078 19.982 6.38411 19.15C5.77745 18.3007 5.40478 17.3213 5.26611 16.212L8.62011 14.704C8.63745 15.9 8.94078 16.8447 9.53011 17.538C10.1194 18.2313 10.9254 18.578 11.9481 18.578C12.9534 18.578 13.7508 18.292 14.3401 17.72C14.9294 17.148 15.2241 16.3767 15.2241 15.406C15.2241 14.4007 14.9294 13.6033 14.3401 13.014C13.7508 12.4247 12.9361 12.13 11.8961 12.13C11.0988 12.13 10.4488 12.2947 9.94611 12.624L8.46411 9.79L13.5081 5.396H5.83811V2.25H17.9541V5.344L12.9881 9.478C14.0281 9.478 14.9814 9.738 15.8481 10.258C16.7321 10.778 17.4341 11.4887 17.9541 12.39C18.4741 13.2913 18.7341 14.2967 18.7341 15.406C18.7341 16.6887 18.4568 17.8067 17.9021 18.76C17.3474 19.7133 16.5588 20.45 15.5361 20.97C14.5134 21.49 13.3174 21.75 11.9481 21.75Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>
</div></div></div><h4>Applied Research</h4><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We validate the best ideas from the research field by scaling them to prototypes at near-frontier scale.</p></div></div><div class="card_primary_element"><div data-wf--icon-by-brand--variant="green" class="card_primary_icon w-variant-a70cd728-ab58-44a2-63b3-85db85238b34"><div class="card_primary_icon-slot"><div aria-hidden="true" data-wf--icon--variant="full" class="u-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M13.17 17.6809H4.61597V14.5609L13.144 2.44495H16.628V14.5349H19.384V17.6809H16.628V21.5549H13.17V17.6809ZM13.17 14.5349V7.56695L8.28197 14.5349H13.17Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>
</div></div></div><h4>Adoption</h4><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We drive adoption of our research through pre-deployment testing and consulting with frontier model developers, technical capacity building with governments, and convening decision makers.</p></div></div><div class="card_primary_element"><div data-wf--icon-by-brand--variant="green" class="card_primary_icon w-variant-a70cd728-ab58-44a2-63b3-85db85238b34"><div class="card_primary_icon-slot"><div aria-hidden="true" data-wf--icon--variant="full" class="u-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M11.8701 21.75C10.0328 21.75 8.53345 21.2733 7.37212 20.32C6.21078 19.3667 5.52612 18.0493 5.31812 16.368L8.62012 15.146C8.63745 16.2207 8.94078 17.07 9.53012 17.694C10.1194 18.3007 10.9081 18.604 11.8961 18.604C12.8841 18.604 13.6814 18.3007 14.2881 17.694C14.9121 17.07 15.2241 16.2553 15.2241 15.25C15.2241 14.2273 14.9208 13.4127 14.3141 12.806C13.7248 12.182 12.9448 11.87 11.9741 11.87C10.6394 11.87 9.60812 12.442 8.88012 13.586L5.86412 12.884L6.43612 2.25H18.0581V5.37H9.58212L9.40012 10.024C9.83345 9.66 10.3014 9.39133 10.8041 9.218C11.3068 9.04467 11.9048 8.958 12.5981 8.958C13.7941 8.958 14.8514 9.218 15.7701 9.738C16.6888 10.2407 17.3994 10.9687 17.9021 11.922C18.4221 12.8753 18.6821 13.9847 18.6821 15.25C18.6821 16.55 18.3961 17.694 17.8241 18.682C17.2695 19.6527 16.4721 20.4067 15.4321 20.944C14.4094 21.4813 13.2221 21.75 11.8701 21.75Z" fill="white"/>
</svg>
</div></div></div><h4>Incentives</h4><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We encourage investments in safety through public communications providing transparent evaluations and ranking of the safety of models, and advising governments.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="main" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-60a7ad7d-02b0-6682-95a5-2218e6fd1490 u-ignore-trim"></div></section><section data-wf--section--variant="inherit" class="u-section"><div data-wf--spacer--variant="main" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-60a7ad7d-02b0-6682-95a5-2218e6fd1490 u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="u-container  "><div data-wf--layout--variant="columns" class="u-layout-wrapper"><div class="u-layout w-variant-558793eb-2b07-490b-9842-2d7e6f6bf325"><div class="u-layout-column-1 u-align-self-start"><div class="u-eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="u-eyebrow-layout"><div class="u-eyebrow-text u-text-style-main w-richtext"><p>WHY FAR.AI</p></div></div></div><div data-number="20" data-wf--typography-heading--variant="h2" class="u-heading w-variant-433d40c6-c261-f13f-c899-61d2cadf150f w-richtext"><h2>What Makes Us Unique</h2></div><div data-number="60" data-wf--typography-paragraph--variant="inherit" class="u-text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>FAR.AI is built for those who want the ambition of a frontier lab, the velocity of a startup, and the impact focus of a non-profit.</p></div><div data-wf--button-main--variant="primary" data-button=" " data-trigger="hover focus" class="button_main_wrap"><div data-wf--clickable--variant="focus-ring-outside" class="clickable_wrap u-cover-absolute"><a aria-label="Join our team" href="/careers" class="clickable_link w-inline-block"></a></div><div class="button_main_element"><div class="button_main_icon u-hide-if-empty"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="button_main_text u-text-style-main">Join our team</div><div class="button_main_icon u-hide-if-empty"></div></div></div></div><div class="u-layout-column-2 w-variant-558793eb-2b07-490b-9842-2d7e6f6bf325  "><div STYLE="" class="u-gap-row-4 u-flex-vertical-nowrap"><div class="u-display-contents"><div data-wf--card-primary--variant="info---no-link-no-icon" class="card_primary_wrap"><div data-trigger="hover-if-clickable focus" class="card_primary_group"><div class="card_primary_element"><div class="card_primary_visual"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="card_primary_image"/></div><div class="card_primary_content u-margin-trim"><h3 class="card_primary_title u-text-style-h4">Adoption and impact</h3><div class="divider"></div><div class="card_primary_text w-richtext"><p>The rigor of a frontier lab, the pace of a startup, and the mission focus of a nonprofit.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--card-primary--variant="info---no-link-no-icon" class="card_primary_wrap"><div data-trigger="hover-if-clickable focus" class="card_primary_group"><div class="card_primary_element"><div class="card_primary_visual"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="card_primary_image"/></div><div class="card_primary_content u-margin-trim"><h3 class="card_primary_title u-text-style-h4">Room to take risks</h3><div class="divider"></div><div class="card_primary_text w-richtext"><p>Space to pursue ambitious, uncertain research without sacrificing freedom.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--card-primary--variant="info---no-link-no-icon" class="card_primary_wrap"><div data-trigger="hover-if-clickable focus" class="card_primary_group"><div class="card_primary_element"><div class="card_primary_visual"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="card_primary_image"/></div><div class="card_primary_content u-margin-trim"><h3 class="card_primary_title u-text-style-h4">Real support</h3><div class="divider"></div><div class="card_primary_text w-richtext"><p>Infrastructure, collaborators, funding, communications, and pathways to real-world adoption.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--variant="main" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-60a7ad7d-02b0-6682-95a5-2218e6fd1490 u-ignore-trim"></div></section><section data-wf--section--variant="inherit" class="u-section"><div data-wf--spacer--variant="main" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-60a7ad7d-02b0-6682-95a5-2218e6fd1490 u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="u-container  "><div data-wf--layout--variant="columns" class="u-layout-wrapper"><div class="u-layout w-variant-558793eb-2b07-490b-9842-2d7e6f6bf325"><div class="u-layout-column-1 u-align-self-start"><div data-number="20" data-wf--typography-heading--variant="h2" class="u-heading w-variant-433d40c6-c261-f13f-c899-61d2cadf150f w-richtext"><h2>Our Team</h2></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--grid--settings-variant="default" STYLE="" data-number="12" class="u-grid-wrapper"><div role="none" data-large-columns="5" data-medium-columns="3" data-small-columns="2" data-xsmall-columns="0" class="u-grid"><div class="u-display-contents w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="u-display-contents w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="u-display-contents w-dyn-item"><div data-trigger="hover focus" class="team-member_wrap"><div class="team-member_group"><img width="Auto" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a53dbc6fa4e1a57fd55a008/6a53dbc6fa4e1a57fd55a14c_686c4c6b2056373c8e8331d9_Adam-Gleave-1.webp" class="team-member_image"/><h3 class="team-member_name u-text-style-h5">Adam Gleave</h3><p class="team-member_role">Co-founder &amp; CEO</p></div><div data-wf--button-main--variant="link" data-button=" " data-trigger="hover focus" class="button_main_wrap w-variant-625d5df4-ad91-f7dc-9e2f-2e69f3fd7400"><div data-wf--clickable--variant="focus-ring-outs